# Team-supplied artwork

These original PNG files are copied without pixel edits from artwork supplied by SYPHU-China for its wiki. Their shapes, scientific symbols and character identity are retained.

- `biotherapeutic-bottlenecks-original.png`: original embedded illustration from `docs/现有活体生物药的缺点.pptx`.
- `drug-therapy-original.png`, `surgery-original.png`, `diet-original.png`: original embedded illustrations from `docs/现有IBD疗法，不足.pptx`.
- `ecn-original.png`, `capsule-original.png`, `gut-original.png`: original transparent PNG attachments supplied by the team on 2026-09-08.

SVG view boxes trim transparent margins at display time. The monochrome care images use CSS inversion and blending for the light page. No AI-generated color proof replaces these production illustrations. Source hashes and the source PPTX audit are recorded in `outputs/art-direction-v2/asset-audit.json` and `outputs/pptx-delivery-audit/` in the local working copy.

The capsule route is a schematic reading journey, not a quantitative transit model or a claim of active bacterial homing.
